    "created_at": "2023-03-13T08:58:45Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-03-13T09:26:12Z",
    "body": "Complexity is already provided by Custom Elements:\r\n- The knowledge fragmentation generated by this new API (explosion of solutions technically complicated to re-resolve same little problems already acheived well in the past from the user land)\r\n- The possibility of creating free of namespace ambiguious elements which breaks what html was aiming to be at the begining : a standard.\r\n\r\nMy proposition aims to resolve at least one of these problems.\r\n\r\nI think you are not impartial, but it s not a reproach at all. I need to admit that I'm not impartial too.\r\nThis is not to generate a controversy, but this divergence is legit.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
