    "updated_at": "2023-03-13T15:55:07Z",
    "body": "I was so hoping to make the project I actually develop \"dde2html\" to be mergeable to html, but I released this not an imperative at all, and it's not possible for now, probably forever. And I understand that it's not realistic to try forcing whatwg/html to follow my needs. My future contributions will be easily more concises and relevants.",
